I've been a print graphic designer for about a dozen years. Lately I
learned some modeling in Maya, although I'm also learning the free and
open source alternative Blender and prefer it.

Speaking of graphics, I intend to create a series of Lojban comics
explaining individual cmavo with examples. I was starting on it when
my graphics tablet broke. I started a fundraising effort to buy a new
one:

http://matt-arnold.livejournal.com/242238.html

If anybody wants to support my ability to make Lojban comics, and
wants in on the personal rewards I'm offering, the Paypal tip jar is
on that site. You have until Saturday evening! Thanks in advance!

-Eppcott


